License: MIT; see DESMOS-UNLOCKED-LICENSE

DesmosPlus bundles an adapted local runtime so the shortcut engine remains
offline. It uses the current calculator's exposed MathQuill field API instead
of replacing the official calculator bundle. The popup uses a locally generated
catalog from the upstream shortcut definitions and MathQuill symbol mappings.
